  "description": "Floxy is a playful graffiti font bursting with fun and urban vibes. Perfect for young audiences, it brings cool street art energy to any design. Whether you’re working on a kid’s project, cartoon-inspired art, or trendy urban graphics, Floxy adds a creative and dynamic edge. With its bold, expressive lines and energetic style, Floxy is ideal for posters, T-shirts, branding, and anything needing a fresh, cool touch. Bring the streets to life with this graffiti-inspired typeface!",
